# Allow-list: the only Dockerfile today (demo/checkout/Dockerfile) needs just
# go.mod, go.sum, and the checkout services. Everything else, including Ruptiq
# Core, .git, and local binaries, stays out of the build context.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!demo/checkout/

# Tests and local build output are not needed in images.
demo/checkout/**/*_test.go
**/*.exe
**/*.test
**/*.out
